{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23878","headline":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 二 · 白居易","name":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫作农夫去，君应见自愁。\n迎春犂瘦地，趂晚餧羸牛。\n数被官加税，稀逢岁有秋。\n不如来饮酒，相伴醉悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23878.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23878","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}